 "provenance": "Tibet 5 normal exit, control-only from the stage spawn. Start values: weaponTier 2 (choosing Tibet on the seal grants the hook tier, cGame.method_75; Tibet 1-6 start with tier 2, the ice hammer is only obtained in Tibet 6), maxHealth 4 (default, no armor), lives 12 (campaign value used by the other Tibet routes; no life is lost), diamonds 0 (the magic lock counts this stage's diamonds). Route: walk-in, switch 15,20 toggles the bridges, checkpoint 1 (18,12); the air column at x=21 is emptied, silver-key chest 23,7, the 22,11 stone is hooked into the column, 30-diamond chest 23,11; riddle room 0 (12,8): bricks broken and the ice creature killed with 4 hammer hits, silver key from chest 4,6; silver locks 17,17 and 17,18 open gate 0; checkpoint 2, stone 30,20 pushed onto plate 32,21 opens gate 1, checkpoint 3 (35,20). Corridor: switch 35,1 hit (bridges back to the start layout), the corridor enemy at 35/36,10 passed between its moves, grass 32,12 entered from 32,13 into the chest room, checkpoint 4 (31,12), gold-key chest 29,12 and 25-diamond chest 28,12 (55 diamonds). Switch 27,12 hit (bridges 28-30,9 open), icicle trap 27,9 triggered from 27,11; the hero runs up the open bridge to 28,8 before the icicle hits switch 27,12, which restores the bridges 28-30,7 and 34,6. Gold lock 37,2 opened. Riddle room 2 (trigger 38,7, defeat 2): bricks broken and the ice creature killed with 4 hammer hits; weight 44,12 hooked to 42,12 and pushed into the niche 41,13 (updraft column 41), stone 40,12 hooked into the column (floats to 41,5), weight 39,12 hooked to 40,12 (updraft column 40), stone pushed 41,5->40,5->39,5 falls onto the shooter 39,9; riddle chest 44,9 gives the second gold key. Gold lock 37,1 opens gate 2 (37,3), magic diamond lock 38,3 passes with 55 diamonds, exit 41,3. Parts up to checkpoint 3 reuse the controls of attempts/t5-cp3.json (recorded with maxHealth 8) replayed unchanged with maxHealth 4; they behave identically.",
